<view class="page-shell">
  <view class="trace-hero zby-card">
    <image src="/images/zhenboyuan/digital-twin.jpg" mode="aspectFill" />
    <view class="trace-mask">
      <text class="trace-kicker">Traceability System</text>
      <text class="trace-title">每一份产品，都能回到真实源头</text>
      <text class="trace-copy">扫码或输入批次号，即可查看产品来源、采收与流通信息。</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="query-panel zby-card">
    <text class="panel-title">批次溯源查询</text>
    <view class="query-row">
      <input value="{{code}}" bindinput="onInput" placeholder="输入批次号" />
      <button bindtap="queryTrace">查询</button>
    </view>
    <button class="scan-btn" bindtap="scanCode">扫码查询产品二维码</button>
  </view>

  <view class="result-card zby-card" wx:if="{{queried}}">
    <text class="result-label">查询结果</text>
    <text class="result-code">{{code}}</text>
    <text class="result-copy">{{result}}</text>
    <view class="tag-row">
      <text class="tag">来源可溯</text>
      <text class="tag">去向可追</text>
      <text class="tag">质量可控</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-title">
    <text>溯源链路</text>
    <text>产品信息一致</text>
  </view>
  <view class="timeline zby-card">
    <view class="timeline-item" wx:for="{{timeline}}" wx:key="title">
      <view class="timeline-dot">{{item.step}}</view>
      <view>
        <text class="timeline-title">{{item.title}}</text>
        <text class="timeline-desc">{{item.desc}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="after-card zby-card">
    <text>查询完成后的下一步</text>
    <text>可继续选购相关产品，也可保留查询记录，便于服务跟进。</text>
    <button class="zby-btn" bindtap="goMall">进入商城</button>
  </view>
</view>
